From: Sandeep Tomer <stomer@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: 16 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] pwhm: add prplMesh DPP command, event, and BSS support

Expose the DPP wpa_ctrl operations needed by the prplMesh WHM adapter,
forward DPP credential/status events, and replay DPP credentials in the
per-BSS hostapd configuration.

Signed-off-by: Sandeep Tomer <stomer@qti.qualcomm.com>
